		<title>Town Clerk | Canton, MA - Official Website</title>

		<meta name="description" content="The Town Clerk is the chief election official.  The clerk supervises voter registration, election officers and the general conduct of elections.  This entails many responsibilities such as scheduling election works, preparing the ballot, setting up the polling place and maintaining voter files.  The Town Clerk is also registrar of vital statics (births, marriages and death records), keeper of public records, recording officer and licensing officer. The Town Clerk also acts as the Parking Clerk for the Town of Canton.">
